{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"身体失去支撑、仍然舍不得与对方心意未知，都接在 H21、H12 及 M44、M46 已确立的心理历程上，将快乐过去后无法立即重新投入的状态解释为局部心理反应，没有新增事件或把音乐变化当作心理原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"快乐退下后留恋并未消失，注意力由兴奋转向尚未解决的牵挂，直接承接 H20、H21、H12 和 M3，而且明确保留幸福的真实性与未来的不确定性，没有改变主线。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"“自己刚才说过的话”具体暗示他此前说过某些话，但已确立的历史只支持亲近、快乐、留恋与回望，并未确立这次言语事件，因此这处引入了未经支持的新事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"从追求满足与答案转向体会亲近本身的珍贵，承接 H12、H13 和原解释第 3 条，并明确保留欲望、未知的对方心意与未解决的不安，没有新增经历或改变主线。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"四条都通过当下的感受和明确的因果解释交代了快乐退去、留恋持续、对方心意未知及注意力转变的过程，不依赖听感记录也能理解其主要心理变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9da6d281-e91d-43b6-a737-19b9017b6ffc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T144054176215Z", "elapsed_seconds": 124.109, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:42:58.310368+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a677965fc17a93140bd74575816e73c668f1a251fb421e034f35a3f41623a922", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "a